945 free Warrants C on the basis of 1 warrant for every 2 existing ordinary shares.","Shareholders approved the appointment of new external auditors and the change of company name at the EGM held on 29 September 2026."],"risks_en":["Latest quarter recorded a net loss of RM0.928 million, widening from the previous quarter.","The VSure Tech acquisition was partly satisfied via the issuance of 200,000,000 new shares, involving dilution.","Future exercise of the free Warrants C may further dilute existing shareholders."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 30 June 2026, revenue was RM1.033 million, down 10.0% QoQ but up 1.8% YoY; net loss was RM0.928 million with a net margin of -89.8%, versus a net margin of 28.5% in the previous quarter."}